    "why": "Jason, 2026-11-19, all approved (reviewed by the session manager): \"thought we adjusted the tools?\", \"this still feels cluttered\" (Change 1: Filters and Sort on the sentence line; Change 2: Call, Directions, ⋯ with words, Link, the score as a chip), \"Why is the search bar still looking like this?\" (the header search's split look, folded to ⌕ on Get Local), \"why would m2 serv core have directions to it when it is only a mailbox?\" (a PO Box gets no Directions), \"thought we fixed this too\" (the comments box), and the concept, \"Build as shown\" with \"Lets build it each way for a A/B test\": Arrange (per page, closed for good, each card's details in order, the computer layout), a Table view with spreadsheet-style column menus, and on computers the list beside a numbered map with the distance ring and Search this area, half of devices each way, counted without who. No new tables.",
